WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.936
Round a decimal by inspecting the digit just to the right of the last wanted place.

00:00:05.783 --> 00:00:13.788
Round 0.370 to 2 decimal place(s). The answer is 0.37. Look at the next decimal digit

00:00:13.788 --> 00:00:15.789
and round to 0.37.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:22.986
A measured length at a science exhibition is 0.717 metres. Round it to two decimal

00:00:22.986 --> 00:00:25.534
place(s). Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:33.108
A measured length at a science exhibition is 0.717 metres. Round it to two decimal

00:00:33.108 --> 00:00:39.849
place(s). The answer is 0.72. Look at the next decimal digit and round to 0.72.
